description:
hdmi dvi adapter fits in both DVI-D (24+1) female and DVI-I (24+5) female port.
Compatible with Type A HDMI cable (not micro HDMI cord, either mini HDMI cord);
Compatible with DVI cable with DVI-D and DVI-I slot

Note: DVID converter interface supports digital signal only, does not natively support audio. So, if you need audio output, you may need an extra HDMI extractor (not included).

DVI D to HDMI adaptor for your second monitor features gold plated connectors for durability, withstand multiple times of plug and unplug;
DVI HDMI adapter features finger-tightened thumbscrews for a secure DVI connection;
